#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:2
msgid "You can manage actions on your clients in a number of different ways:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດບໍລິຫານຈັດການການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆເທິງ Client ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can schedule automated recurring actions to apply the highstate or an "
"arbitrary set of custom states to clients on a specified schedule."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ highstate ຫຼື ຊຸດສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບ Client ຕາມຕາຕະລາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can apply recurring actions to individual clients, to all clients in a "
"system group, or to an entire organization."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆກັບ Client ແຕ່ລະຕົວ, ທຸກ Client ໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ຫຼື ທັງໝົດອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can set actions to be performed in a particular order by creating action "
"chains."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າການດຳເນີນການໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ກຳນົດ ໂດຍການສ້າງ action chains."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Action chains can be created and edited ahead of time, and scheduled to run "
"at a time that suits you."
msgstr "Action chains ສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄວ້ກ່ອນລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້, ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນເວລາທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:7
msgid "You can also perform remote commands on one or more of your Salt clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Remote commands allows you to issue commands to individual Salt clients, or "
"to all clients that match a search term."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can apply recurring actions on individual Salt clients, to a system "
"group, or to all clients in an organization."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Currently, {productname} supports the following action types as recurring "
"actions:"
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ, {productname} ຮອງຮັບປະເພດການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:12
msgid "[parameter]``Highstate:`` Execute the highstate."
msgstr "[parameter]``Highstate:`` ປະມວນຜົນ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:13
msgid ""
"[parameter]``Custom state:`` Execute a set of custom states. A custom state "
"can be either an internal state provided by {productname}, or a "
"configuration channel created by a user."
msgstr "[parameter]``Custom state:`` ປະມວນຜົນຊຸດສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງອາດຈະເປັນສະຖານະພາຍໃນທີ່ {productname} ມີໃຫ້, ຫຼື ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Recurring Action"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to an individual client, navigate to "
"[guimenu]``Systems``, click the client to configure schedules for, and "
"navigate to the [guimenu]``Recurring Actions`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆກັບ Client ແຕ່ລະຕົວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Systems``, ຄລິກເລືອກ Client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດເວລາ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Recurring Actions``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to a system group, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups], select the group to configure schedules for, "
"and navigate to [guimenu]``Recurring Actions`` tab."
msgstr "ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Groups], ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດເວລາ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Recurring Actions``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:19
msgid "Select an action type from the [guimenu]``Action Type`` dropdown."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດການດຳເນີນການຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Action Type``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:20
msgid "Type a name for the new schedule."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບກຳນົດເວລາໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:21
msgid "Choose the frequency of the recurring action:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:22
msgid "[guimenu]``Hourly:`` Type the minute of each hour."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Hourly:`` ລະບຸນາທີຂອງແຕ່ລະຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``15`` runs the action at fifteen minutes past every "
"hour."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``15`` ຈະເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການໃນນາທີທີສິບຫ້າຂອງທຸກໆຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:24
msgid "[guimenu]``Daily:`` Select the time of each day."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Daily:`` ເລືອກເວລາຂອງແຕ່ລະວັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``01:00`` runs the action at 0100 every day, in the "
"timezone of the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``01:00`` ຈະເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການເວລາ 01:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ, ຕາມໂຊນເວລາຂອງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:26
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Weekly:`` Select the day of the week and the time of the day, to "
"execute the action every week at the specified time."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Weekly:`` ເລືອກວັນໃນອາທິດ ແລະ ເວລາ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການທຸກໆອາທິດຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:27
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Monthly:`` Select the day of the month and the time of the day, "
"to execute the action every month at the specified time."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Monthly:`` ເລືອກວັນໃນເດືອນ ແລະ ເວລາ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການທຸກໆເດືອນຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:28
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Custom Quartz format:`` For more detailed options, enter a custom "
"quartz string."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Custom Quartz format:`` ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບ quartz."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For example, to run a recurring action at 0215 every Saturday of every "
"month, enter:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການເວລາ 02:15 ທຸກໆວັນເສົາຂອງແຕ່ລະເດືອນ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"
msgstr "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Toggle the [guimenu]``Test mode`` switch on to run the schedule in "
"test mode."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເປີດສະວິດ [guimenu]``Test mode`` ເພື່ອລອງເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດທົດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For actions of type [parameter]``Custom state``, select the states from the "
"list of available states and click btn:[Save Changes]. This will only save "
"the current state selection and not the schedule."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການປະເພດ [parameter]``Custom state``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖານະຈາກລາຍການທີ່ມີ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save Changes]. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະບັນທຶກສະເພາະສະຖານະທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກກຳນົດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the next pane, drag and drop the selected states to put them in the "
"execution order and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຖັດໄປ, ໃຫ້ລາກ ແລະ ວາງສະຖານະທີ່ເລືອກເພື່ອຈັດລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Schedule] to save, and see the complete list of existing "
"schedules."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ, ແລະ ເບິ່ງລາຍການກຳນົດເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Organization Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in the organization.  Navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > "
"Recurring Actions] to see all recurring actions that apply to the entire "
"organization."
msgstr "ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານອົງກອນສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆສຳລັບ Client ທັງໝົດໃນອົງກອນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Organization > Recurring Actions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຜົນກັບທັງອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:36
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in all organizations.  Navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations], select "
"the organization to manage, and navigate to the menu:States[Recurring "
"Actions] tab."
msgstr "ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ {productname} ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂການດຳເນີນການແບບຊ້ຳໆສຳລັບ Client ທັງໝົດໃນທຸກອົງກອນ. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations], ເລືອກອົງກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:States[Recurring Actions]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Chains"
msgstr "ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ (Action Chains)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If you need to perform a number of sequential actions on your clients, you "
"can create an action chain to ensure the order is respected."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງຕາມລຳດັບເທິງ Client ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ action chain ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າວຽກຕ່າງໆຈະເຮັດຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:39
msgid ""
"By default, most clients execute an action as soon as the command is "
"issued.  In some case, actions take a long time, which could mean that "
"actions issued afterwards fail.  For example, if you instruct a client to "
"reboot, then issue a second command, the second action could fail because "
"the reboot is still occurring.  To ensure that actions occur in the correct "
"order, use action chains."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, Client ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກທັນທີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄຳສັ່ງ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ວຽກອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ສົ່ງຕາມຫຼັງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານສັ່ງໃຫ້ Client ຣີບູດ ແລ້ວສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງທີສອງທັນທີ, ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນອາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຍ້ອນເຄື່ອງກຳລັງຣີບູດຢູ່. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້, ຄວນໃຊ້ action chains."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, an action chain is executed inside a "
"single snapshot, until there is a reboot action.  This can cause some "
"limitations."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບແບບ transactional update, action chain ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນ snapshot ດຽວ ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການຣີບູດ. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] "
"and xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] ແລະ xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:42
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:43
msgid ""
"You can use action chains on all clients.  Action chains can include any "
"number of these actions, in any order:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ action chains ໄດ້ກັບທຸກ Client. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດລວມເອົາການດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງຕາມລຳດັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:44
msgid "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:45
msgid "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:46
msgid "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:47
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:48
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:49
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:50
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:51
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:52
msgid "menu:System Details[Configuration]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Configuration]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:53
msgid "menu:Images[Build]"
msgstr "menu:Images[Build]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Action chains are user-specific.  To see the action chain in the {webui}, "
"you must sign in as the same user who created the action chain."
msgstr "Action chains ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງ action chain ໃນ {webui}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຂົ້າລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີດຽວກັນກັບຜູ້ທີ່ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Action Chain"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Action Chain ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the first action you want to "
"perform in the action chain.  For example, navigate to [guimenu]``System "
"Details`` for a client, and click btn:[Schedule System Reboot]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ວຽກທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃນ action chain. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``System Details`` ຂອງ Client, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Schedule System Reboot]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Add to`` field and select the action chain you want to "
"add to:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add to`` ແລ້ວເລືອກ action chain ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມວຽກໃສ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:58
msgid "If this is your first action chain, select ``new action chain``."
msgstr "ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນ action chain ທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``new action chain``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:59
msgid "If the action chain already exists, select it from the list."
msgstr "ຖ້າ action chain ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If you already have existing action chains, but you want to create a new "
"action chain, start typing a name for the new action chain to create it."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີ action chain ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຢາກສ້າງອັນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:61
msgid "Confirm the action."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:62
msgid ""
"The action is not performed immediately, it creates the new action chain, "
"and a blue bar confirming this appears at the top of the screen."
msgstr "ວຽກຈະຍັງບໍ່ເລີ່ມເຮັດທັນທີ, ແຕ່ຈະເປັນການສ້າງ action chain ໃໝ່ ແລະ ມີແຖບສີຟ້າຢືນຢັນສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Continue adding actions to your action chain by checking the [guimenu]``Add "
"to`` field and selecting the name of the action chain to add them to."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມວຽກອື່ນໆເຂົ້າໃນ action chain ຕໍ່ໄປ ໂດຍການເລືອກຊື່ action chain ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Add to``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:64
msgid ""
"When you have finished adding actions, navigate to menu:Schedule[Action "
"Chains] and selecting the action chain from the list."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Action Chains] ແລ້ວເລືອກ action chain ນັ້ນຈາກລາຍການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Re-order actions by dragging them and dropping them into the correct "
"position."
msgstr "ຈັດລຳດັບວຽກໃໝ່ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງລົງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Click the blue plus sign to see the clients an action is to be performed "
"on.  Click btn:[Save] to save your changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກສີຟ້າເພື່ອເບິ່ງ Client ທີ່ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ. ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Schedule a time for your action chain to run, and click btn:[Save and "
"Schedule]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ action chain ເຮັດວຽກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save and Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If you leave the page without clicking either btn:[Save] or btn:[Save and "
"Schedule] all unsaved changes are discarded."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານອອກຈາກໜ້ານີ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ຫຼື btn:[Save and Schedule], ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If one action in an action chain fails, the action chain stops, and no "
"further actions are executed."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີວຽກໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ action chain ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຕ່ອງໂສ້ນັ້ນຈະຢຸດທັນທີ ແລະ ວຽກທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:70
msgid ""
"You can see scheduled actions from action chains by navigating to "
"menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໃນ action chains ໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote Commands)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:72
msgid ""
"You can configure clients to run commands remotely.  This allows you to "
"issue scripts or individual commands to a client, without having access to "
"the client directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:73
msgid ""
"This feature is automatically enabled on Salt clients, and you do not need "
"to perform any further configuration.  You can use this procedure to enable "
"it manually, instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure your client is subscribed to the appropriate tools "
"child channel for its installed operating system.  For more information "
"about subscribing to software channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ Client ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງເຄື່ອງມື (tools child channel) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. * For transactional update systems, consider that a remote command is run inside a single snapshot.
#.   This can cause some limitations.
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:75
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, consider that a remote command is run "
"inside a single snapshot.  This can cause some limitations.  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] and "
"xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບ transactional update, ໃຫ້ຮູ້ໄວ້ວ່າຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈະເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນ snapshot ດຽວ. ເຊິ່ງອາດມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] ແລະ xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:76
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, consider that a remote command is run "
"inside a single snapshot.  This can cause some limitations.  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບ transactional update, ໃຫ້ຮູ້ໄວ້ວ່າຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈະເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນ snapshot ດຽວ. ເຊິ່ງອາດມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Remote commands are run from the [path]``/tmp/`` directory on the client.  "
"To ensure that remote commands work accurately, do not mount ``/tmp`` with "
"the [parameter]``noexec`` option.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc[Troubleshooting "
"Mounting /tmp with noexec]."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈະເຮັດວຽກຈາກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/tmp/`` ເທິງ Client. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຫ້າມ mount ``/tmp`` ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [parameter]``noexec``. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc[Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:78
msgid ""
"All commands run from the [guimenu]``Remote Commands`` page are executed as "
"{rootuser} on clients.  Wildcards can be used to run commands across any "
"number of systems.  Always take extra care to check your commands before "
"issuing them."
msgstr "ທຸກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ສົ່ງຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``Remote Commands`` ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນນາມ {rootuser} ເທິງ Client. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ wildcards ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາຫຼາຍລະບົບພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ຄວນກວດກາຄຳສັ່ງໃຫ້ລະອຽດກ່ອນສົ່ງທຸກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running Remote Commands on Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກໃນ Salt Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:80
msgid "Navigate to menu:Salt[Remote Commands]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Remote Commands]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the first field, before the ``@`` symbol, type the command you want to "
"issue."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທຳອິດ, ກ່ອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``@``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In the second field, after the ``@`` symbol, type the client you want to "
"issue the command on."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງທີສອງ, ຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``@``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ Client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:83
msgid ""
"You can type the ``minion-id`` of an individual client, or you can use "
"wildcards to target a range of clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດພິມ ``minion-id`` ຂອງ Client ຕົວດຽວ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ wildcards ເພື່ອລະບຸຫຼາຍ Client ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Find targets] to check which clients you have targeted, and "
"confirm that you have used the correct details."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Find targets] ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ Client ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:85
msgid "Click btn:[Run command] to issue the command to the target clients."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Run command] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາ Client ເປົ້າໝາຍ."

