#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compliance as Code"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນຮູບແບບລະຫັດ (Compliance as Code)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This document provides insight on running compliance as code remediation "
"using an Ansible Playbook."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (compliance remediation) ໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more infomation about running compliance as code remediation using a "
"bash script, see xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ bash script, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:openscap.adoc#remediation[Remediation]."

#. Procedure: Installing the SCAP security guide package
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:5
msgid ""
"An Ansible control node is required.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Ansible control node. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The following procedure will guide you through running remediation using an "
"Ansible Playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Run Remediation Using an Ansible Playbook"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປະມວນຜົນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ Ansible Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:8
msgid ""
"From the control node system menu select menu:Ansible[Playbooks].  Expand "
"the folder tab, then select a playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:9
msgid "Click the playbook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To run the playbook, select the OS **Inventory Path** for the client, for "
"example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
msgstr "/etc/ansible/sles15\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:12
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:86
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:93
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc:13
msgid "Check the status of the scheduled event under the [guimenu]``Events`` tab."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງສະຖານະຂອງວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໄດ້ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ [guimenu]``Events``."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible Integration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Ansible"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Currently, the supported version of Ansible is 2.9 (LTS) shipped in SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools channels.  The supported OS version for the "
"Ansible Control Node is {sles} 15 SP3, or later.  Ansible software is also "
"available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} Branch Server.  "
"For Control Nodes running operating systems other than {sle}, use Ansible "
"shipped together with your distribution."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ, ເວີຊັນຂອງ Ansible ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ 2.9 (LTS) ທີ່ມີມາໃນຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 Client Tools. ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ Ansible Control Node ແມ່ນ {sles} 15 SP3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ຊອບແວ Ansible ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server. ສຳລັບ Control Node ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {sle}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Ansible ທີ່ມາກັບຊຸດຊອບແວ (distribution) ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງຟີເຈີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to operate their Ansible Control "
"Nodes.  Supported features are:"
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານລະບົບສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ Ansible Control Nodes ໄດ້. ຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:5
msgid "inspection of inventory files"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:6
msgid "discovery of playbooks"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:7
msgid "execution of playbooks"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນ playbooks"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:8
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The inventory is a sorted list of managed Ansible nodes.  For more "
"information about organizing an inventory, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."
msgstr "Inventory ແມ່ນລາຍການທີ່ຈັດລຽງຂອງ Ansible nodes ທີ່ຖືກຄວບຄຸມ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ inventory ໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Playbooks are a way to describe how the inventory is to be managed.  For "
"more information about playbooks, see "
"https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."
msgstr "Playbooks ແມ່ນວິທີການອະທິບາຍວ່າຈະຈັດການ inventory ແນວໃດ. ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/playbook_guide/playbooks_intro.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and Basic Configuration"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To use Ansible features, you need to register the already existing Ansible "
"Control Node as a Salt client to the {productname} Server.  In the {webui}, "
"on the menu:System Details[Properties] page of the registered system, you "
"must enable the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type of the "
"[guimenu]``Add-on System Types`` list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Enabling the ``Ansible Control Node`` system type ensures that the "
"[package]``ansible`` package is installed on the system by adding it in the "
"highstate and activates the Ansible features under the menu:System "
"Details[Ansible] tab."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ປະເພດລະບົບ ``Ansible Control Node`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າແພັກເກັດ [package]``ansible`` ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໂດຍການເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ highstate ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີ Ansible ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ menu:System Details[Ansible]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:14
msgid ""
"As the next step, configure the paths to your Ansible playbook directories "
"and inventory files on the menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node] "
"page.  As an inventory path, you can use the standard Ansible inventory path "
"[literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``.  As a playbook directory, you can use any "
"directory on the control node, where your playbook files are stored.  A "
"playbook directory either contains [literal]``.yml`` files or subdirectories "
"with [literal]``.yml`` files."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ playbook directories ແລະ inventory files ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Control Node]. ສຳລັບ inventory path, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ [literal]``/etc/ansible/hosts``. ສຳລັບ playbook directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂຟນເດີໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນ control node ທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ playbook ໄວ້. ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບັນຈຸໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml`` ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [literal]``.yml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For installing and setting up an Ansible Control Node, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"After defining an inventory path, you can use {productname} to inspect its "
"contents."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ inventory path ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອກວດສອບເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Inspecting an Inventory from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບ Inventory ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Inventories]"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:System Details[Ansible > Inventories]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Click an inventory path to execute the inventory inspection on the Control "
"Node in real-time."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ inventory path ເພື່ອເລີ່ມກວດສອບ inventory ເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ (real-time)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"After defining a playbook directory, you can discover playbooks on the "
"menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks] page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດ playbook directory ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ playbooks ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"As with the inventory inspection, the playbook discovery operations run on "
"the Control Node in real-time."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການກວດສອບ inventory, ການຄົ້ນຫາ playbook ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງ Control Node ແບບຣຽວທາມ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Playbook Execution"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນ Playbook"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can schedule a playbook execution from the menu:System Details[Ansible > "
"Playbooks] page.  After selecting the playbook you wish to execute, you can "
"select the inventory file for the execution from the [guimenu]``Inventory "
"Path`` drop-down menu of the [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution`` "
"dialog.  If you do not select any item, the default inventory configured in "
"your Control Node will be used.  The drop-down menu is populated with the "
"inventories you defined in your Inventory paths and with inventories that "
"have been locally discovered in your playbook directories.  These are "
"displayed as [guimenu]``Custom Inventory`` items in the playbook details.  "
"You can also enter an arbitrary inventory path."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການປະມວນຜົນ playbook ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າ menu:System Details[Ansible > Playbooks]. ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກ playbook ທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟລ໌ inventory ໄດ້ຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Inventory Path`` ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ [guimenu]``Schedule Playbook Execution``. ຖ້າບໍ່ເລືອກອັນໃດ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ inventory ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ Control Node. ລາຍການໃນເມນູນີ້ຈະມາຈາກ inventory ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ ຈາກການຄົ້ນຫາພາຍໃນ playbook directories ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງເປັນ [guimenu]``Custom Inventory``. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງ inventory ໃດກໍໄດ້ເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-integration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Afterwards, you choose the time of the playbook execution or select an "
"action chain.  Eventually, {productname} executes the playbook as an action "
"on the Control Node.  You can see the result of the operation on the action "
"details page."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ເລືອກ action chain. ໃນທີ່ສຸດ {productname} ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ playbook ເປັນການດຳເນີນການໜຶ່ງເທິງ Control Node. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດການດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup Ansible Control Node"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up an Ansible control node, execute the following steps from the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible control node, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To configure a client as the Ansible Control Node, the Ansible package must "
"be installed on that system.  Usually, the Ansible package should be "
"obtained from the operating system vendor's official repositories.  For "
"example, on {sle} 15 SP6 and SP7, Ansible is available through the "
"[literal]``Systems Management Module.``"
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Client ໃຫ້ເປັນ Ansible Control Node, ຕ້ອງມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ Ansible ໃນລະບົບນັ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງ Ansible ຈາກຄັງເກັບທາງການຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນ {sle} 15 SP6 ແລະ SP7, Ansible ມີໃຫ້ຜ່ານ [literal]``Systems Management Module.``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Only for older {sle} 15 clients, Ansible is available through SLES 15 Client "
"tools but there it will be dropped in the future."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Client {sle} 15 ລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, Ansible ຈະມີໃຫ້ຜ່ານ SLES 15 Client tools ແຕ່ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up Ansible Control Node on a {sle} 15 SP6 or SP7 system"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ansible Control Node ເທິງລະບົບ {sle} 15 SP6 ຫຼື SP7"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > "
"Products], verify that [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 "
"x86_64`` (or later) with the [literal]``Systems Management Module`` and the "
"required [literal]``Python 3 Module`` are selected and synchronized."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products], ກວດສອບວ່າ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64`` (ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ) ພ້ອມກັບ [literal]``Systems Management Module`` ແລະ [literal]``Python 3 Module`` ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:7
msgid "Deploy a {sle} 15 SP6 (or later) client."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Client {sle} 15 SP6 (ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the menu:Systems[Overview] page of "
"the client.  Select menu:Software[Software Channels] and subscribe the "
"client to the [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64`` (or "
"later SP), [literal]``Systems Management Module`` and [literal]``Python 3 "
"Module`` channels."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ menu:Systems[Overview] ຂອງ Client. ເລືອກ menu:Software[Software Channels] ແລະ ໃຫ້ Client ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ [literal]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 SP6 x86_64``, [literal]``Systems Management Module`` ແລະ [literal]``Python 3 Module``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Select menu:Details[Properties] of your client.  From the [literal]``Add-On "
"System Types`` list enable [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` and click "
"btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ menu:Details[Properties] ຂອງ Client. ຈາກລາຍການ [literal]``Add-On System Types`` ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [guimenu]``Ansible Control Node`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Navigate to the client overview page, select menu:State[Highstate], and "
"click btn:[Apply Highstate]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ໜ້າພາບລວມຂອງ Client, ເລືອກ menu:State[Highstate], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:11
msgid "Select the menu:Events[] tab and verify the status of the highstate."
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ menu:Events[] ແລະ ກວດສອບສະຖານະຂອງ highstate."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you want to install a newer Ansible on a {sle} 15 SP4 or SP5 client, you "
"must enable the [literal]``Python 3 Module``."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Ansible ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າເທິງ Client {sle} 15 SP4 ຫຼື SP5, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ [literal]``Python 3 Module``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Newer versions of Ansible no longer support managing nodes with outdated "
"Python versions.  If a managed node still defaults to an older Python "
"version, you may encounter connection errors or failures during playbook "
"runs.  To address this, user should upgrade Python on the managed node, if "
"possible and set the correct Python interpreter in the Ansible inventory or "
"configuration."
msgstr "Ansible ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ໆຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການ nodes ທີ່ໃຊ້ Python ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ. ຖ້າ node ຍັງໃຊ້ Python ລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ playbook ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນອັບເກຣດ Python ໃນ node ນັ້ນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Python interpreter ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Ansible inventory ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ansible Integration tools deploy a playbook as an inventory file.  Create "
"one inventory file for each operating system listed in _Table 1_."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Ansible ຈະໃຊ້ playbook ເປັນໄຟລ໌ inventory. ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ inventory ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ລະບຸໃນ _Table 1_."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Ansible Inventory Files"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Ansible Inventory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create and add your hosts to an inventory file to be managed by Ansible.  "
"The default path for an Ansible inventory is [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມ hosts ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ inventory ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Ansible ຈັດການ. ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Ansible inventory ແມ່ນ [path]``/etc/ansible/hosts``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inventory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Inventory"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org "
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"
msgstr ""
"client240.mgr.example.org\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/some_ssh_key\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup1]\n"
"client241.mgr.example.org\n"
"client242.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr ""
"[mygroup2]\n"
"client243.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr ""
"[all:vars]\n"
"ansible_ssh_private_key_file=/etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, from the [guimenu]``Ansible`` tab navigate to "
"menu:Ansible[Control Node] to add inventory files to the control node."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``Ansible`` ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Ansible[Control Node] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ inventory ເຂົ້າໃນ control node."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Under the [literal]``Playbook Directories`` section add "
"[literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` to the [literal]``Add a "
"Playbook Directories`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``Playbook Directories`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [literal]``/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible`` ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add a Playbook Directories`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Under [literal]``Inventory Files`` add your inventory file locations to the "
"[literal]``Add an Inventory file`` field and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ [literal]``Inventory Files`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ inventory ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Add an Inventory file`` ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/ansible/sles15\n"
"/etc/ansible/sles12\n"
"/etc/ansible/centos7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For additional playbook examples, see "
"https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ playbook ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/ansible/ansible-examples."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establish Communication with Ansible Nodes"
msgstr "ສ້າງການສື່ສານກັບ Ansible Nodes"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Establishing Communication with Ansible Nodes"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສື່ສານກັບ Ansible Nodes"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:31
msgid "Create the SSH keys that you are using in your inventory."
msgstr "ສ້າງ SSH keys ທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ໃນ inventory ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "ssh-keygen -f /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:33
msgid "Copy the generated SSH keys to the Ansible managed clients.  Example:"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ SSH keys ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຍັງ Client ທີ່ Ansible ຈັດການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key "
"root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"
msgstr "ssh-copy-id -i /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key root@client240.mgr.example.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:35
msgid "Declare the private key in [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` as follows:"
msgstr "ລະບຸ private key ໃນ [path]``/etc/ansible/ansible.cfg`` ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"
msgstr "private_key_file = /etc/ansible/my_ansible_private_key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Replace [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` with the name of the file "
"containing the private key."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [path]``my_ansible_private_key`` ເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ private key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Test that Ansible is working by executing the following commands from the "
"control node:"
msgstr "ທົດສອບວ່າ Ansible ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ control node:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"
msgstr ""
"ansible all -m ping\n"
"ansible mygroup1 -m ping\n"
"ansible client240.mgr.example.org -m ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/ansible-setup-control-node.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You may now run remediations.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ (remediations) ໄດ້ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-compliance-as-code.adoc[]."

#.  bsc#1213077 #9
#.  section on how to create playbooks, and how to schedule their execution.
#.  Add a description of the "Playbooks" tab, in general context.
#.  There is a very summarized descriptions in next section "Compliance as code", but we // need a description of the playbooks tab that is independent of usage with openscap.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ (Auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, you can keep track of your clients through a series of "
"auditing tasks.  You can check that your clients are up to date with all "
"public security patches (CVEs), perform subscription matching, and use "
"OpenSCAP to check for specification compliance."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມ Client ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານວຽກງານການກວດສອບຕ່າງໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າ Client ໄດ້ອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ຄວາມປອດໄພ (CVEs) ຄົບຖ້ວນຫຼືບໍ່, ເຮັດການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້, ແລະ ໃຊ້ OpenSCAP ເພື່ອກວດສອບການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Audit`` to perform "
"auditing tasks."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Audit`` ເພື່ອເລີ່ມວຽກງານການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Audits"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) is a fix for a publicly known "
"security vulnerability."
msgstr "CVE (Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures) ແມ່ນການແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຕໍ່ສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:6
msgid "You must apply CVEs to your clients as soon as they become available."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງ CVE ໃຫ້ກັບ Client ຂອງທ່ານທັນທີທີ່ມີການເຜີຍແຜ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Each CVE contains an identification number, a description of the "
"vulnerability, and links to further information.  CVE identification numbers "
"use the form ``CVE-YEAR-XXXX``."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ CVE ຈະມີໝາຍເລກປະຈຳຕົວ, ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່, ແລະ ລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ໝາຍເລກ CVE ຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ``CVE-ປີ-ເລກສີ່ຫຼັກ``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit] to see a "
"list of all clients and their current patch status."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການ Client ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, the patch data is updated at 23:00 every day.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest patches."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating Patch Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນແພັດຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the ``cve-server-channels-default`` schedule."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລ້ວເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາ ``cve-server-channels-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[cve-server-channels-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task.  Allow the task to "
"complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວຽກ. ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Verifying Patch Status"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:15
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[CVE Audit]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To check the patch status for a particular CVE, type the CVE identifier in "
"the [guimenu]``CVE Number`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບ CVE ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ພິມໝາຍເລກ CVE ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``CVE Number``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Select the patch statuses you want to look for, or leave all statuses "
"checked to look for all."
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາ, ຫຼື ໝາຍເລືອກທັງໝົດເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທຸກສະຖານະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Audit Servers] to check all systems, or click btn:[Audit Images] "
"to check all images."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Servers] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກລະບົບ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Audit Images] ເພື່ອກວດສອບທຸກອິມເມຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about the patch status icons used on this page, see "
"xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄອຄອນສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້ານີ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:audit/audit-cve-audit.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For each system, the [guimenu]``Actions`` column provides information about "
"what you need to do to address vulnerabilities.  If applicable, a list of "
"candidate channels or patches is also given.  You can also assign systems to "
"a [guimenu]``System Set`` for further batch processing."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບ, ຖັນ [guimenu]``Actions`` ຈະບອກຂໍ້ມູນວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຍັງແດ່ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່. ຖ້າມີ, ມັນຈະສະແດງລາຍການຊ່ອງທາງ ຫຼື ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຈັດລະບົບເຂົ້າໃນ [guimenu]``System Set`` ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແບບກຸ່ມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} API to verify the patch status of your "
"clients.  Use the ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus`` API method.  For more "
"information about this method, see the {productname} API Guide."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອກວດສອບສະຖານະແພັດຊ໌ຂອງ Client ໄດ້. ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມທອດ ``audit.listSystemsByPatchStatus``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນຄູ່ມື {productname} API."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL"
msgstr "OVAL"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In addition to retrieving CVE information from channel data, {productname} "
"now includes an experimental feature that fetches CVE details from OVAL "
"files.  This functionality is currently considered a *Technology Preview*."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ CVE ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງແລ້ວ, ປະຈຸບັນ {productname} ຍັງມີຟີເຈີທົດລອງທີ່ດຶງລາຍລະອຽດ CVE ຈາກໄຟລ໌ OVAL. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຖືວ່າເປັນ *Technology Preview* (ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ) ໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Users are encouraged to experiment with this feature and share feedback.  "
"However, it is not yet recommended for production use without thorough "
"testing in a test environment."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາສະໜັບສະໜູນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລອງໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນຄວາມຄິດເຫັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍັງບໍ່ທັນແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບຈິງໂດຍບໍ່ຜ່ານການທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The CVE Audit operation relies on two primary data sources: channels and "
"OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language).  These two sources "
"provide the metadata for conducting CVE audits, each serving a distinct "
"purpose."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CVE ຈະອີງຕາມແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກສອງຢ່າງຄື: ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language). ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງສອງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາສຳລັບການກວດສອບ CVE ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຢ່າງມີຈຸດປະສົງຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:26
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:99
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:111
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:121
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Channels include the updated software packages, including the patches, and "
"provide insights into the essential patches required to address "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆຈະລວມເອົາແພັກເກັດຊອບແວທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່, ລວມເຖິງແພັດຊ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL (Technology Preview)"
msgstr "OVAL (Technology Preview)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In contrast, OVAL data supply the information about vulnerabilities "
"themselves, and packages that render a system vulnerable to a CVE."
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ເອງ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບສ່ຽງຕໍ່ CVE ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:30
msgid ""
"While it is possible to conduct CVE audits using only channels data, "
"synchronizing OVAL data enhances the accuracy of the results, particularly "
"in cases involving zero-day vulnerabilities or partially patched "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້, ແຕ່ການຊິງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຜົນລັດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ແບບ zero-day ຫຼື ຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ທີ່ຍັງແກ້ໄຂບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"OVAL data is much more lightweight than channels data.  For example, OVAL "
"data for {opensuse} Leap 15.4 is around 50{nbsp}MB."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ມີຂະໜາດເບົາບາງກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼາຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ສຳລັບ {opensuse} Leap 15.4 ມີຂະໜາດປະມານ 50 MB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Having synced OVAL data only, you can already perform CVE audits and check "
"if your systems are vulnerable or not to a CVE, but you can't apply patches "
"since they come from channels."
msgstr "ຖ້າຊິງພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດກວດສອບ CVE ແລະ ເບິ່ງວ່າລະບົບສ່ຽງຫຼືບໍ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດຊ໌ໄດ້ ເພາະແພັດຊ໌ຕ້ອງມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:33
msgid "Key characteristics of the OVAL feature include:"
msgstr "ລັກສະນະທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງຟີເຈີ OVAL ມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Disabled by default*: The feature is turned off by default and must be "
"explicitly enabled by the user by updating the configuration file "
"[litaral]``rhn.conf`` and restarting relevant services.\n"
msgstr "*ຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ*: ຟີເຈີນີ້ຖືກປິດໄວ້ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ເອງໂດຍການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [litaral]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຣີສະຕາດບໍລິການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Reversible*: If any issues arise, users can revert back to the standard "
"channel-based CVE audit.\n"
msgstr "*ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້*: ຖ້າພົບບັນຫາ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກັບໄປໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ CVE ແບບອີງຕາມຊ່ອງທາງປົກກະຕິໄດ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Performance considerations*: While initial testing has been conducted, "
"there are still concerns regarding performance, and further optimizations "
"may be needed.\n"
msgstr "*ການພິຈາລະນາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ*: ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີການທົດສອບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຍັງມີຄວາມກັງວົນເລື່ອງປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:37
msgid ""
"OVAL data is updated at 23:00 every day by default.  We recommend that "
"before you begin a CVE audit you refresh the data to ensure you have the "
"latest vulnerabilities metadata."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເວລາ 23:00 ຂອງທຸກໆວັນ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນເລີ່ມການກວດສອບ CVE ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OVAL Data Support"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:39
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:45
msgid "Add or modify the following setting in [literal]``rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [literal]``rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:41
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:47
msgid "Restart the Tomcat and Taskomatic services:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດບໍລິການ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:42
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat taskomatic\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:43
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues and need to revert to the default behavior, disable "
"the feature by setting:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານພົບບັນຫາ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ປິດຟີເຈີນີ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling OVAL Data Support"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດການຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"
msgstr "java.cve_audit.enable_oval_metadata=false\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating OVAL Data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Task Schedules] and "
"select the ``oval-data-sync-default`` schedule."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules] ແລ້ວເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາ ``oval-data-sync-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:51
msgid "Click btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[oval-data-sync-bunch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Single Run Schedule] to schedule the task."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Single Run Schedule] ເພື່ອກຳນົດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:53
msgid "Allow the task to complete before continuing with the CVE audit."
msgstr "ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ວຽກເຮັດສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກວດສອບ CVE ຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect CPE"
msgstr "ການເກັບກຳ CPE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:55
msgid ""
"To be able to accurately identify what vulnerabilities apply to a certain "
"client, we need to identify the operating system product that client "
"uses. To do that, we collect the CPE (Common Platform Enumeration) of the "
"client as a salt grain, then we save it to the database."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບຸໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງວ່າຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດມີຜົນກັບ Client, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງລະບຸຜະລິດຕະພັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ Client ນັ້ນໃຊ້. ໂດຍການເກັບກຳ CPE (Common Platform Enumeration) ຂອງ Client ໃນຮູບແບບ salt grain, ແລ້ວບັນທຶກລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"The CPE of newly registered clients will be automatically collected and "
"saved to the database.  However, for existing clients, it is necessary to "
"execute the ``Update Packages List`` action at least once."
msgstr "CPE ຂອງ Client ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເກັບກຳ ແລະ ບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບ Client ເກົ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການ ``Update Packages List`` ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Update Packages List"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ອັບເດດລາຍການແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All] "
"and select a client."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List > All] ແລ້ວເລືອກ Client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Then go to the [guimenu]``Software`` tab and select the "
"[guimenu]``Packages`` sub-tab."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Software`` ແລະ ເລືອກແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Packages``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Update Packages List] to update packages and collect the CPE of "
"client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Packages List] ເພື່ອອັບເດດແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ເກັບກຳ CPE ຂອງ Client."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:61
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL Sources"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:62
msgid ""
"To ensure the integrity and currency of the OVAL data, {productname} "
"exclusively consumes OVAL data from the official maintainers of every "
"product. Below, you can find the list of OVAL data sources."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໃນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ທັນສະໄໝຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL, {productname} ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ຈາກຜູ້ດູແລຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຂອງແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍການແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL ໄດ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Product | Source URL\n"
"| openSUSE Leap .5+.^| https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/oval\n"
"| openSUSE Leap Micro\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Server\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Desktop\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro\n"
"| RedHat Enterprise Linux | https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2\n"
"| Debian | https://www.debian.org/security/oval\n"
"| Ubuntu | https://security-metadata.canonical.com/oval\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຜະລິດຕະພັນ | URL ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"| openSUSE Leap .5+.^| https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/oval\n"
"| openSUSE Leap Micro\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Server\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Desktop\n"
"| SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro\n"
"| RedHat Enterprise Linux | https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2\n"
"| Debian | https://www.debian.org/security/oval\n"
"| Ubuntu | https://security-metadata.canonical.com/oval\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"OVAL metadata is used in CVE auditing for only a subset of clients, namely, "
"clients that use openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian or "
"Ubuntu. This is due to the absence of OVAL vulnerability definitions "
"metadata for the other products."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ OVAL ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບ CVE ສຳລັບ Client ບາງກຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຄື: Client ທີ່ໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian ຫຼື Ubuntu. ເນື່ອງຈາກຍັງບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ OVAL vulnerability definitions ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either ``affected``, ``not affected``, "
"or ``patched``.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr "ສະຖານະ CVE ຂອງ Client ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນ ``affected`` (ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ``not affected`` (ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ), ຫຼື ``patched`` (ລົງແພັດຊ໌ແລ້ວ). ສະຖານະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:68
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ {productname}, ມີຄຳນິຍາມດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ຕໍ່າກວ່າເວີຊັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:72
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີແພັກເກັດໃດໆທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ກົງກັບແພັກເກັດໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ລົງແພັດຊ໌ແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:74
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ມີແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນໃນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:76
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ {productname} ຮູ້ຈັກໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:78
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລະບົບ, ຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກັອບປີ້ມາ, ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງ service pack ໃນອະດີດ ຫຼື ອະນາຄົດຂອງລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}, ຜົນການກວດສອບ CVE ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈັດການ, ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ອາດຈະມີການລາຍງານທີ່ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM) using SSSD.  PAM is a suite of libraries that "
"allows you to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication "
"mechanism, eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  "
"{productname} supports LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based "
"authentication protocols."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລະບົບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ຜ່ານ SSSD. PAM ແມ່ນຊຸດຂອງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຊື່ອມໂຍງ {productname} ເຂົ້າກັບກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບລວມສູນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈື່ລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼາຍອັນ. {productname} ຮອງຮັບ LDAP, Kerberos, ແລະ ໂປຣໂຕຄອນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSSD Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring SSSD"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[Create User] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ PAM."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, [literal]``-``, "
"[literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, and [literal]``@`` are allowed."
msgstr "ໃນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ນອກຈາກຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລກແລ້ວ, ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``-``, [literal]``_``, [literal]``.``, ແລະ [literal]``@`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)`` checkbox."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure SSSD in the server container.  At the command prompt of the "
"{productname} container host, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSSD ໃນ server container. ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ container, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` according to your configuration.  For an "
"example, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`` ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "When done, exit the container:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ອອກຈາກ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid "Restart {productname} using:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:43
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
#: modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:34
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {productname} {webui} ຈະປ່ຽນສະເພາະລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນ {productname} Server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ PAM ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ, ລະຫັດຜ່ານທ້ອງຖິ່ນອາດຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເລີຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ລະຫັດຜ່ານ Kerberos ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກົນໄກການປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about PAM configuration, see the {sles} Security "
"Guide. The Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for "
"other network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to "
"configure an Active Directory (AD) service.  For more information, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PAM, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນຄູ່ມືຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ {sles}. ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ແລະ ວິທີຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Active Directory (AD). ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ {sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "LDAP Integration with Active Directory Example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For LDAP integration with Active Directory, you can use the following "
"example."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ LDAP ກັບ Active Directory, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the code snippet, change the following placeholders according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນຂອງໂຄ້ດ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຕົວປ່ຽນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$domain``"
msgstr "[literal]``$domain``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:22
msgid "Your domain name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "[literal]``$ad_server``"
msgstr "[literal]``$ad_server``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:24
msgid ""
"FQDN of the AD server if it is not auto-detected from the "
"[literal]``$domain`` [literal]``$uyuni-hostname``: The name of the machine "
"this AD client is supposed to be known.  If not set, it will be "
"[literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."
msgstr "FQDN ຂອງ AD server ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ໄດ້ກວດພົບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ [literal]``$domain``. ສ່ວນ [literal]``$uyuni-hostname`` ແມ່ນຊື່ເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ AD client ນີ້ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້, ມັນຈະເປັນ [literal]``uyuni-server.mgr.internal``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:25
msgid "Example snippet for [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄ້ດສຳລັບ [path]``/etc/sssd/sssd.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"
msgstr ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[nss]\n"
msgstr "[nss]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "[pam]\n"
msgstr "[pam]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"
msgstr ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"
msgstr "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 21.0.1 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, SSO ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍການເປີດເຜີຍສາມຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ກັບ {productname}, ແລະ ໃຊ້ Keycloak 21.0.1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Start by installing the Keycloak IdP, then setting up the {productname} "
"Server.  Then you can add the endpoints as Keycloak clients, and create "
"users."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak IdP, ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server. ແລ້ວທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ endpoints ເປັນ Keycloak clients ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນການອະທິບາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. {suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ແນະນຳ ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ, ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Keycloak. ສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໂດຍກົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ຣັນໃນ container. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຣັນ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak, ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມື Keycloak ທີ່ https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the Identity Service Provider"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install Keycloak in a Podman container, according to the Keycloak "
"documentation."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ໃນ Podman container ຕາມຄູ່ມືຂອງ Keycloak."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Run the container using the ``-td`` argument to ensure the process remains "
"running:"
msgstr "ຣັນ container ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ ``-td`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໂປຣເຊສຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e "
"KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"
msgstr "podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_USER=admin -e KEYCLOAK_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:21.0.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Sign in the Keycloak {webui} as the ``admin`` user, and create an "
"authentication realm using these details:"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າລະບົບ Keycloak {webui} ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``admin``, ແລະ ສ້າງ authentication realm ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Name`` field, enter a name for the realm."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບ realm."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:12
msgid "For example, ``SUMA``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ``SUMA``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the ``Endpoints`` field, click the ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider "
"Metadata`` link."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Endpoints``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກລິ້ງ ``SAML 2.0 Identity Provider Metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This will lead you to a page where you will see the endpoints and "
"certificate to copy into the {productname} configuration file."
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາໜ້າທີ່ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ endpoints ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ເພື່ອກັອບປີ້ໄປໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When you have installed Keycloak and created the realm, you can prepare the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Keycloak ແລະ ສ້າງ realm ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຽມ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting Up the {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file and edit these parameters."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Replace ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` with the fully qualified domain name of your "
"{productname} installation:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_SUMA>`` ເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນ (FQDN) ຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = "
"https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the configuration file, replace ``<FQDN_IDP>`` with the fully qualified "
"domain name of your Keycloak server."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ ``<FQDN_IDP>`` ເປັນ FQDN ຂອງ Keycloak server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:21
msgid "Replace ``<REALM>`` with your authentication realm, for example ``SUMA``:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ ``<REALM>`` ເປັນ authentication realm ຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ``SUMA``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:23
msgid "In the IdP metadata, locate the public x509 certificate."
msgstr "ໃນ IdP metadata, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ x509 ສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:24
msgid ""
"It uses this format: "
"``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``.  In the "
"configuration file, specify the public x509 certificate of the IdP:"
msgstr "ມັນຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ: ``http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml/descriptor``. ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ x509 ສາທາລະນະຂອງ IdP:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"<CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- <CERTIFICATE>  -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. +
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Here is an example of [path]``rhn.conf`` on {productname} after enabling "
"SSO:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ [path]``rhn.conf`` ໃນ {productname} ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ SSO:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:27
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# This is the configuration file for Single Sign-On (SSO) via SAMLv2 "
"protocol\n"
"# To enable SSO, set java.sso = true in /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# Mandatory changes: search this file for:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# See product documentation and the comments inline in this file for more\n"
"# information about every parameter.\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"#\n"
"# If 'strict' is True, then the Java Toolkit will reject unsigned\n"
"# or unencrypted messages if it expects them signed or encrypted\n"
"# Also will reject the messages if not strictly follow the SAML\n"
"#\n"
"# WARNING: In production, this parameter setting parameter MUST be set as "
"\"true\".\n"
"# Otherwise your environment is not secure and will be exposed to attacks.\n"
"# Enable debug mode (to print errors)\n"
"# Identifier of the SP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
msgstr ""
"# ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Single Sign-On (SSO) ຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄອນ SAMLv2\n"
"# ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ java.sso = true ໃນ /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"#\n"
"# ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ: ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບ:\n"
"# - YOUR-PRODUCT\n"
"# - YOUR-IDP-ENTITY\n"
"#\n"
"# ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ນີ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີ.\n"
"#\n"
"# ຫາກ 'strict' ເປັນ True, Java Toolkit ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ມີການລົງນາມ\n"
"# ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ຫາກມັນຄາດຫວັງໃຫ້ມີການລົງນາມ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"# ແລະ ຈະປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມມາດຕະຖານ SAML ຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ\n"
"#\n"
"# ຄຳເຕືອນ: ໃນລະບົບຈິງ, ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງເປັນ \"true\".\n"
"# ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ອາດຖືກໂຈມຕີໄດ້.\n"
"# ເປີດໂໝດ debug (ເພື່ອພິມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ)\n"
"# ຕົວລະບຸ (Identifier) ຂອງ SP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <AuthnResponse> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"# URL Location where the <Response> from the IdP will be returned\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <AuthnResponse> ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນ\n"
"# ຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ເຊິ່ງໃນທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"# URL ທີ່ <Response> ຈາກ IdP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນມາ\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Specifies info about where and how the <Logout Response> message MUST be\n"
"# returned to the requester, in this case our SP.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = "
"https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"# ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບບ່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ວິທີການທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ <Logout Response> ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນ\n"
"# ຫາຜູ້ຮ້ອງຂໍ, ໃນທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ SP ຂອງພວກເຮົາ.\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = https://sumaserver.example.org/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Identifier of the IdP entity (must be a URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = "
"http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຕົວລະບຸຂອງ IdP entity (ຕ້ອງເປັນ URI)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid = http://idp.example.org:8080/realms/SUMA\n"

