#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can add the {productname} endpoints to Keycloak.  Keycloak refers to "
"endpoints as clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ {productname} endpoints ເຂົ້າໃນ Keycloak ໄດ້. ເຊິ່ງ Keycloak ຈະເອີ້ນ endpoints ວ່າ clients."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Endpoints as Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Endpoints ເປັນ Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:39
msgid "In the Keycloak {webui}, create a new client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ client ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:40
msgid "In the ``Client type`` field, select ``SAML``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``SAML``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the ``Client ID`` field, enter the endpoint specified in the server "
"configuration file as ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client ID``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:42
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:43
msgid "In the ``Settings`` tab, fine-tune the client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Settings``, ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:44
msgid "Toggle the ``Sign assertions`` switch to ``On``."
msgstr "ເປີດສະວິດ ``Sign assertions`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:45
msgid "In the ``Signature algorithm`` field, select ``RSA_SHA1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Signature algorithm``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``RSA_SHA1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:46
msgid "In the ``SAML Signature Key Name`` field, select ``Key ID``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``SAML Signature Key Name``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``Key ID``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:47
msgid "In the ``Keys`` tab:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Keys``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:48
msgid "Set ``Client signature required`` to ``Off``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Client signature required`` ເປັນ ``Off``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the ``Advanced`` tab, in the ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration`` "
"section, add the two endpoints using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Advanced``, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສອງ endpoints ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In both the ``Assertion Consumer Service`` fields, enter the endpoint "
"specified in the server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Assertion Consumer Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:51
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In both the ``Logout Service`` fields, enter the endpoint specified in the "
"server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Logout Service``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:53
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ``https://<FQDN_SUMA>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When you have added the endpoints as clients, you can configure the client "
"scope, and map the users between Keycloak and {productname}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມ endpoints ເປັນ clients ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ client scope ແລະ ຈັບຄູ່ (map) ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງ Keycloak ແລະ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Client Scope and Mappers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Client Scope ແລະ Mappers"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the Keycloak {webui}, navigate to the menu:Clients[Client scopes] tab and "
"assign ``role_list`` as the default client scope."
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Clients[Client scopes] ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ``role_list`` ເປັນ client scope ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] tab and add a mapper for user "
"attribute ``uid``, using the default values."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ເເພີ່ມ mapper ສຳລັບ attribute ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``uid`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:58
msgid "This SAML attribute is expected by {productname}."
msgstr "SAML attribute ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ {productname} ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] and click on ``role_list`` "
"mapper. Set ``Single Role Attribute`` to ``On``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ mapper ``role_list``. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Single Role Attribute`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:60
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Users[Admin] section and create an administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ menu:Users[Admin] ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:61
msgid "This user does not need to match the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຜູ້ບໍລິຫານຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Role mappings] tab, add an attribute named "
"``uid`` with a value that matches the username of the {productname} "
"administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Role mappings], ເພີ່ມ attribute ຊື່ ``uid`` ໂດຍມີຄ່າກົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (username) ຂອງຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Credentials] tab, and set the same password as "
"used by the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Users[Credentials], ແລະ ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານອັນດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ {productname} ໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid " Save your changes."
msgstr " ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When you have completed the configuration, you can test that the "
"installation is working as expected.  Restart the {productname} Server to "
"pick up your changes, and navigate to the {productname} {webui}.  If your "
"installation is working correctly, you are redirected to the Keycloak SSO "
"page, where you can authenticate successfully."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຣີສະຕາດ {productname} Server ເພື່ອໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ {productname} {webui}. ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປທີ່ໜ້າ Keycloak SSO ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະບົບ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO) ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ ແມ່ນຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຫຼາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ພຽງຊຸດດຽວ. SAML ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດສິດ. ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ SAML (IdP) ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດສິດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SP) ເຊັ່ນ: {productname}. {productname} ຈະເປີດນຳໃຊ້ສາມຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (endpoints) ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບດ້ວຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SLO), ແລະ ບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ (SLS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Assertion ແລະ nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, ແລະ LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ endpoint ຂອງບໍລິການຜູ້ບໍລິໂພກ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ endpoint ຂອງບໍລິການອອກຈາກລະບົບຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ metadata ຂອງ SP (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊັນລາຍເຊັນໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ SAML ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ (ກະລຸນາກວດສອບກັບເອກະສານຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"``mgr-sync`` or ``spacecmd`` continue to work with the default "
"authentication method only."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນຈາກວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປເປັນການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ, ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ SSO ໃໝ່ຈະມີຜົນກັບ {webui} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງມືຝັ່ງໄຄເອັນ (Client) ເຊັ່ນ ``mgr-sync`` ຫຼື ``spacecmd`` ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນພາຍນອກດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ກວດສອບເອກະສານ IdP ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named ``uid`` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ IdP ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໃນ SAML:Attribute. ເຊິ່ງ SAML:Attribute ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ IdP ແລະ ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ {productname} ໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SAML. ຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attribute) ນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ກັບມັນຫຼັງຈາກລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເປີດນຳໃຊ້ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ endpoints ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (ຫຼື ACS): ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SAML ສຳລັບການສ້າງເຊສຊັນ (session) ເຂົ້າໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (Service Provider)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ ACS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "Single logout service (ຫຼື SLS): ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຮ້ອງຂໍອອກຈາກລະບົບຈາກ IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ SLS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: ເປັນ endpoint ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບ SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "Endpoint ສຳລັບ metadata ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user ``orgadmin`` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the ``orgadmin`` user, "
"provided that the ``orgadmin`` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ IdP ໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ໃນນາມຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin``, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SSO ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນປະເພດອື່ນໄດ້: ມັນຈະຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ SSO ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: modules/administration/pages/iss_v2.adoc:7
#: modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server "
"container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆ ພາຍໃນ server container."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພວກເຂົາຂຶ້ນມາກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"and prefix them with [literal]``java.sso``.  For example, in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` find:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງລົງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕື່ມໜ້າ (prefix) ດ້ວຍ [literal]``java.sso``. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` by prefixing the option name with ``java.sso.``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງມັນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍການຕື່ມໜ້າຊື່ຕົວເລືອກດ້ວຍ ``java.sso.``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` and [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``.  "
"Every parameter comes with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາທຸກຈຸດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນ, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຕົວແທນ (placeholders) [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` ແລະ [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``. ແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີຈະມີຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆ ກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການບໍລິການ spacewalk ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງ {productname}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງ IdP ສຳລັບ SSO ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບມາຍັງ {productname} {webui} ໃນສະຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະບົບແລ້ວ. ຫາກທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ SSO, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບ log ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍວິທີ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າເຖິງ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ແລະ ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວ (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up, and "
"introduces the [command]``mgradm backup`` tool to create {productname} "
"backups and information about restoring from your backups in the case of a "
"system failure."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ລວມທັງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ມັນຈຶ່ງມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent data loss and "
"enable quick recovery."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນລະບົບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສາມເທົ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ ທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຢູ່. ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ເຕັມອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ສະນັ້ນຄວນກວດສອບເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
msgid "[command]``smdba`` backup tool is deprecated in {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use [command]``mgradm backup create`` command.  This can save you time "
"in administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and "
"re-synchronize in the case of failure.  However, this method requires "
"significant disk space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໃນການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ລວມທັງຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command performs backup to a directory.  "
"This directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຈະດຳເນີນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ. ເຊິ່ງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mounted) ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command allows various customizations of "
"the content of the backup.  For all available options, see [command]``mgradm "
"backup create --help``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create --help``."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full Backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມຮູບແບບຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມຮູບແບບຂອງ {productname} ປະກອບດ້ວຍການສຳຮອງສ່ວນປະກອບດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມ (volumes) ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "ຄວາມລັບ (secrets) ຂອງ podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ systemd ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "container images ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped during creation of a full "
"backup."
msgstr "ບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} ຈະຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Full Backup with [command]``mgradm backup create``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມຮູບແບບດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm backup create``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
msgid "Replace [literal]``$path`` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$path`` ໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial Backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` tool allows creating partial backups.  It "
"is possible to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and "
"images."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm backup create`` ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຂ້າມບາງວໍລຸມ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ, ຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ images ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໃນຂະບວນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບສອງໄລຍະໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
msgid "Partial backup cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຄົບຖ້ວນ (consistency) ຂອງການສຳຮອງ/ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Partial Backup by Skipping Database Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Partial Backup by Skipping a Volume."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be included "
"in the backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid "Use [literal]``all`` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``all`` ເພື່ອຂ້າມວໍລຸມທັງໝົດ, ຍົກເວັ້ນວໍລຸມຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນວໍລຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup`` command uses internal list of {productname} "
"volumes.  If additional volumes were configured during the installation, or "
"additional volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified "
"using [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup`` ຈະໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}. ຫາກມີວໍລຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມວໍລຸມອື່ນໆ ເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating Backup with Additional Custom Volume"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be included "
"in the backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$volumes`` ໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງວໍລຸມທີ່ຕ້ອງການລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມທີ່ຕ້ອງການລວມໂດຍຂັ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a Manual Database Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Manual Database Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "ຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the Existing Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຈະກວດສອບລາຍການສຳຮອງສຳລັບວໍລຸມ, images ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອເລີ່ມການກູ້ຄືນ. ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ວໍລຸມພາຍໃນ ແຕ່ຈະກວດຫາທຸກວໍລຸມ ຫຼື image ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລວບລວມລາຍການທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນແລ້ວ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໄປຂຽນທັບວໍລຸມ, image ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ສ່ວນການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍການຄຳນວນຄ່າ checksum ຂອງລາຍການສຳຮອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການກວດສອບທັງສອງຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈຶ່ງຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "ບໍລິການຂອງ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an Existing Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ (re-deploy) {productname} Server ຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation. If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"[command]``--skipverify`` option."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຫາກຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບປະກັນດ້ວຍວິທີອື່ນແລ້ວ, ສາມາດຂ້າມການກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipverify``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` option can be used."
msgstr "ຫາກດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂ້າມການກູ້ຄືນວໍລຸມທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended Steps after Restoring a Backup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended Steps after {productname} Restore"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the [command]``mgr-sync`` tool at the command "
"prompt in the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or "
"skip the registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ຂອງ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ command prompt ໃນ container. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຂ້າມສ່ວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການສ້າງ SSL certificate ໄປກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/``.  "
"If "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` "
"was not in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/` "
"with a complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the "
"[command]``rhn-search`` service is started.  This command produces only "
"debug messages, it does not produce error messages.  In the container, "
"enter:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກັດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channels) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child channels). ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ສ່ວນຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້. ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງແບບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ ມີພຽງແພັກເກັດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຈະໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ (repositories) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດ. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນຕົວຈຳລອງ (mirror) ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ແພັກເກັດລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດມີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນຊອບແວຈາກຄັງເກັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ໄຄເອັນສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscribe) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງໄຄເອັນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນໄຄເອັນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກັດຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງໄດ້. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານເອງ ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ (custom channels) ໄດ້. ຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ ຫຼື ຈະນຳໄປເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` section and check "
"[guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to "
"this channel``.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel``. ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Subscribers`` tab and select or deselect users as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Subscribers`` ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກ command prompt."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "ການຄຳນວນແບບເປັນຄວາມລັບ (Confidential Computing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການປົກປ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນລະດັບຮາດແວ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫ້ຄວາມປອດໄພລະດັບສູງສຳລັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄວາມລັບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຊອດໂຄ້ດ (code integrity)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງ TEE ແມ່ນຖືກກວດສອບດ້ວຍຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນ (attestation). {productname} ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນ attestation server ສຳລັບລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້. ມັນຈະສ້າງໜ້າລາຍງານສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດນີ້. ລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ ແລະ ກວດສອບເປັນປະຈຳ. ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບໃນອະດີດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຕາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ (Attestation) ຂອງ {CoCo} ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລະບົບນັ້ນໆ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid "{CoCo} Attestation is only available on x86_64 architecture."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ x86_64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is SLES15 SP6 and bootstrapped to "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນ (virtual machine) ຕ້ອງເປັນ SLES15 SP6 ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (bootstrapped) ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Hardware must have [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` or [literal]``AMD EPYC "
"Genoa CPU``"
msgstr "ຮາດແວຕ້ອງໃຊ້ [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` ຫຼື [literal]``AMD EPYC Genoa CPU``"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS ຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}."
msgstr "Host OS ແລະ ຊອບແວການຈຳລອງລະບົບ (KVM ແລະ libvirt) ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບ {CoCo}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
#: modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "SLES15 SP6 has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "SLES15 SP6 ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບ Technology Preview (ລຸ້ນທົດສອບ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "{productname} ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ໃນຮູບແບບ Technology Preview."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and SNP Guest "
"are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ KVM secure boot ແລະ SNP Guest ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {CoCo} ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {CoCo} ໃນ host ຂອງທ່ານ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ OS."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation Container ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with [literal]``mgradm install podman``."
msgstr "Attestation container ຈະຖືກເປີດນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgradm install podman``."

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "Add the following to file [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter [literal]``mgradm``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດນຳໃຊ້ attestation container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale --coco-replicas 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ attestation container ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale --coco-replicas 0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດນຳໃຊ້ Attestation"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "ເປີດນຳໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນ (attestation) ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມເປີດ/ປິດ (toggle button)."

#. . (PLACEHOLDER) Enable the automatic attestaion at reboot by selecting the toggle button [literal]``Execution``.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Environment Type`` select the correct option from "
"the drop-down list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Environment Type`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກລາຍການ (drop-down list)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation1-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation1-v2.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການຢືນຢັນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Attestation]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Earliest`` select the time of running the "
"attestation."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Earliest`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມດຳເນີນການຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting [literal]``Add to`` option."
msgstr "ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຢືນຢັນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກ (action chain) ໂດຍການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``Add to``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການຢືນຢັນໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation2-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation2-v2.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນຈາກລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍງານທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation3-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation3-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
msgid ""
"After clicking the selected attestation report tab [literal]``Overview`` "
"will open."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນທີ່ເລືອກ, ແຖບ [literal]``Overview`` ຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation4-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation4-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid "Move to the next tab [literal]``SEV-SNP``."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ແຖບຖັດໄປ [literal]``SEV-SNP``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation5-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation5-v2.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
msgid "Finally, move to the next tab [literal]``Secure Boot``."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ແຖບຖັດໄປ [literal]``Secure Boot``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation6-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation6-v2.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from Audit"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນຈາກ Audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:54
msgid "From the navigation bar, select menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:55
msgid "The list of all attestations will be shown in the main panel."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງການຢືນຢັນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນແຜງຫຼັກ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "attestation7-v2.png"
msgstr "attestation7-v2.png"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report Statuses"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:59
msgid "Attestation reports can have one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ລາຍງານການຢືນຢັນສາມາດມີສະຖານະໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າ (Pending)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:61
msgid ""
"This is the default status of the scheduled attestation.  The report is "
"still not available, either because the process has not yet started or "
"completed."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຢືນຢັນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ລາຍງານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ, ອາດເປັນຍ້ອນຂະບວນການຍັງບໍ່ທັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ (Successful)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:63
msgid ""
"When the scheduled attestation creates a report which can be viewed, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Successful``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຢືນຢັນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Successful``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ (Failed)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When the scheduled fails and does not create a report as a result, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Failed``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຢືນຢັນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ເກີດຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງລາຍງານໄດ້, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Failed``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related Topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#.  * For more information about {CoCo}, see [link]``https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing`` (external link).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:67
msgid ""
"For more information about {CoCo}, see "
"[link]``https://confidentialcomputing.io`` (external link)."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {CoCo}, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ [link]``https://confidentialcomputing.io`` (ລິ້ງພາຍນອກ)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (Content Lifecycle Management). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂປຣເຈັກສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນປະກອບດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງ 'ຕາມວັນທີ' (By Date)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງ (build) ໂປຣເຈັກໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ (patch) ອອກຈາກໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມແພັດຊ໌ (patch) ເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣເຈັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The ``By Date`` filter excludes all patches released after a specified "
"date.  This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow "
"a monthly patch cycle."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ ``By Date`` ຈະຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້. ຕົວຕອງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໂປຣເຈັກວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາທີ່ດຳເນີນຕາມຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ລາຍເດືອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the ``By Date`` Filter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Issue "
"date)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Issue date)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, [guimenu]``later or equal`` is "
"autoselected."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``later or equal`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:19
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:25
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:45
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:62
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:146
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding the Filter to the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Filter to a Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date`` filter."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date`` ອັນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applying the Filter to a New Project Build"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຕົວຕອງຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂປຣເຈັກ. ເພື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ (build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the Filter"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ (message)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕາມປະຫວັດການສ້າງ (build history) ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ໃນ server ທົດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Promote] ເພື່ອເລື່ອນລະດັບເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (build) ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນ ຫາກທ່ານມີຕົວຕອງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຕອງນັ້ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Excluding a Patch from the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເມື່ອພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນວັນທີໃນຕົວຕອງ 'ຕາມວັນທີ'."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a Patch"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory "
"Name)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory Name)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:42
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:57
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``equals``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type a name for the advisory."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (advisory)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:44
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:46
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:99
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:83
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:101
msgid "Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link, select [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk "
"patch``, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk patch``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you rebuild the project with the btn:[Build] button, the new filter is "
"used together with the [guimenu]``by date`` filter we added before."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໂປຣເຈັກຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Build], ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``by date`` ທີ່ພວກເຮົາເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Including a Patch in the Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In this example, you have received a security alert.  An important security "
"patch was released several days after the first of the month you are "
"currently working on.  The name of the new patch is ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``.  "
"You need to include this new patch into your environment."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພ. ແພັດຊ໌ຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາ ຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີໜຶ່ງຂອງເດືອນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດມື້. ຊື່ຂອງແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ແມ່ນ ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວມແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Allow`` filters rule overrides the exclude function of the "
"[guimenu]``Deny`` filter rule.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກົດຂອງຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Allow`` (ອະນຸຍາດ) ຈະເຮັດວຽກທັບ (override) ຟັງຊັນການຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງ ກົດຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Deny`` (ປະຕິເສດ). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Including a Patch in a Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:54
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:55
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type "
"[guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, and check [guimenu]``Allow``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Allow``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:59
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:98
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to store the filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂປຣເຈັກຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select [guimenu]``Include kernel "
"security patch``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Include kernel security patch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an Existing Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອບວຽນການອັບເດດແພັດຊ໌ຂອງເດືອນໃດໜຶ່ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດຮອບວຽນແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``by date`` field, change the date of the filter to the next "
"month."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``by date``, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນວັນທີຂອງຕົວຕອງເປັນເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣເຈັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` can be detached from "
"the project."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບ ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` ສາມາດຖອດອອກ (detach) ຈາກໂປຣເຈັກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີແພັດຊ໌ໃໝ່ທີ່ອອກມາແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the ``allow`` filter you added previously."
msgstr "ຖອດຕົວຕອງ ``allow`` ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "ແພັດຊ໌ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (rebuild) ໂປຣເຈັກຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ທີ່ລວມແພັດຊ໌ສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a Project with Live Patching"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການເຮັດ live patching."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ kernel ພຽງເວີຊັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ live patching ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກັບ kernel ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ສະເພາະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ live patching ແມ່ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບແພັດຊ໌ດຽວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the ``required reboot`` flag."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະ kernel patch ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊຸດໃໝ່ຂອງ live patching kernels ຈະສະແດງ ສັນຍາລັກ (flag) ``required reboot`` (ຕ້ອງມີການເປີດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "kernel patches ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມື live patching. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ reboot ລະບົບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງພາຍໃນໜຶ່ງປີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະການອັບເດດ live patch ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ kernel ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "Live patches ແມ່ນຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັດຊ໌ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເປັນເອກະລາດ (stand-alone)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນ kernel patches ແບບປົກກະຕິທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າ ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude Packages with a Higher Kernel Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the ``SUSE-15-2019-1244`` "
"patch.  This patch contains ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ທ່ານໄດ້ອັບເດດລະບົບຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍແພັດຊ໌ ``SUSE-15-2019-1244``. ເຊິ່ງແພັດຊ໌ນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍ ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"[package]``kernel-default`` and [package]``kernel-default-base``."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດຊ໌ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນສູງກວ່າຂອງ [package]``kernel-default`` ແລະ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding Packages with a Higher Kernel Version"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Contains "
"Package)``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Contains Package)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``version greater than``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``version greater than``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Package Name`` field, type [systemitem]``kernel-default``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Package Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel-default``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the the [guimenu]``Epoch`` field empty."
msgstr "ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Epoch`` ວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Version`` field, type [systemitem]``4.12.14``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Version``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``4.12.14``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Release`` field, type [systemitem]``150.17.1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Release``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Select [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You need to repeat this procedure for the [package]``kernel-default-base`` "
"package."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຊ້ຳອີກຄັ້ງສຳລັບແພັກເກັດ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກ btn:[Build], ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ເຊິ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ນີ້ ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍ kernel patches ທັງໝົດຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "kernel patches ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນ kernel ສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກນຳອອກ. Live patching kernels ຈະຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນແພັດຊ໌ທຳອິດໃນຊຸດນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (filter template). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ live patching, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a New Kernel Version for Live Patching"
msgstr ""

