"\n"
"|salt_queue_thread_pool_task_total\n"
"|counter\n"
"|ຈຳນວນວຽກທັງໝົດທີ່ເຄີຍຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄິວ\n"
"\n"
"|salt_queue_thread_pool_completed_task_total\n"
"|counter\n"
"|ຈຳນວນວຽກທັງໝົດທີ່ເຄີຍສຳເລັດຕໍ່ຄິວ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:129
msgid ""
"Every salt_queue value has a label named `queue` with the queue number as "
"value."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄ່າຂອງ salt_queue ຈະມີເລເບວ (label) ຊື່ວ່າ `queue` ໂດຍມີເລກລຳດັບຄິວເປັນຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "Taskomatic Scheduler (port 9800)"
msgstr "Taskomatic Scheduler (ພອດ 9800)"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|Metric |Type | Description\n"
"\n"
"|taskomatic_scheduler_threads\n"
"|counter\n"
"|Number of scheduler threads ever created\n"
"\n"
"|taskomatic_scheduler_threads_active\n"
"|gauge\n"
"|Number of currently active scheduler threads\n"
"\n"
"|taskomatic_scheduler_completed_task_count\n"
"|counter\n"
"|Number of tasks ever completed\n"
msgstr ""
"|Metric |Type | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
"\n"
"|taskomatic_scheduler_threads\n"
"|counter\n"
"|ຈຳນວນ threads ຂອງ scheduler ທີ່ເຄີຍຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ\n"
"\n"
"|taskomatic_scheduler_threads_active\n"
"|gauge\n"
"|ຈຳນວນ threads ຂອງ scheduler ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ\n"
"\n"
