#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:19
msgid ""
"RHEL 7 and compatible systems provide a [package]``scap-security-guide`` "
"package, which contains outdated contents.  You are advised to use the "
"[package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` package you will find in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "RHEL 7 ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຈະມີແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ເຊິ່ງມີເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເກົ່າແລ້ວ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide-redhat`` ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້ໃນເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:20
