"[package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} supports the following profiles:"
msgstr "{suse} ຈັດຫາແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ OpenSCAP ຕ່າງໆ. ໃນເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ [package]``scap-security-guide``, {suse} ຮອງຮັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
