#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:45
msgid "Take a note of the file paths and profiles for performing the scan."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file paths) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແກນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform an Audit Scan"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:47
msgid ""
"When you have installed or transferred your content files, you can perform "
"audit scans.  Audit scans can be triggered using the {productname} {webui}.  "
"You can also use the {productname} API to schedule regular scans."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການສະແກນກວດສອບໄດ້. ການສະແກນກວດສອບສາມາດສັ່ງການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ API ຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການສະແກນແບບປົກກະຕິໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an Audit Scan from the {webui}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to scan."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແກນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Audit`` tab, and the [guimenu]``Schedule`` "
"subtab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Audit``, ແລະ ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Schedule``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document`` field, enter the parameters for "
"the SCAP template and profile you want to use on the client.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພາຣາມີເຕີສຳລັບແທັມເພລດ SCAP ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Command: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval\n"
"  Command-line arguments: --profile "
"xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig\n"
"  Path to XCCDF document: "
"/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds-1.2.xml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:53
msgid ""
"If you use [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources`` parameter a lot of RAM is "
"required.  In addition, you may need to increase the value of "
"[literal]``file_recv_max_size``."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ພາຣາມີເຕີ [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources`` ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າຂອງ [literal]``file_recv_max_size``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:54
msgid "The scan runs at the client's next scheduled synchronization."
msgstr "ການສະແກນຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນຮອບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (synchronization) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:55
msgid ""
"The XCCDF content file is validated before it is run on the remote system.  "
"If the content file includes invalid arguments, the test fails."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ XCCDF ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກລັນໃນລະບົບທາງໄກ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາມີອາກິວເມນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການທົດສອບຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an Audit Scan from the API"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure that the client to be scanned has Python and "
"XML-RPC libraries installed."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແກນມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ແລະ XML-RPC libraries."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Choose an existing script or create a script for scheduling a system scan "
"through ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງສະຄຣິບໃໝ່ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການສະແກນລະບົບຜ່ານ ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:60
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:61
msgid "``<1000010001>`` is the system ID (sid)."
msgstr "``<1000010001>`` ແມ່ນລະຫັດລະບົບ (sid)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:62
msgid ""
"``<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>`` is the path to the content file location on the "
"client.  For example, "
"[path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds-1.2.xml``."
msgstr "``<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>`` ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds-1.2.xml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:63
msgid ""
"``<profile_name>`` is an additional argument for the [command]``oscap`` "
"command.  For example, use "
"``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."
msgstr "``<profile_name>`` ແມ່ນອາກິວເມນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``oscap``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ ``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:64
msgid "Run the script on the client you want to scan, from the command prompt."
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແກນ, ຈາກໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan Results"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Information about the scans you have run is in the {productname} {webui}.  "
"Navigate to to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] for a table of results.  For "
"more information about the data in this table, see "
"xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສະແກນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ລັນແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຜົນລັດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:67
msgid ""
"To ensure that detailed information about scans is available, you need to "
"enable it on the client.  In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Organizations] and click on the organization the client is a part "
"of.  Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab, and check the "
"[guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files`` option.  When enabled, "
"this generates an additional HTML file on every scan, which contains extra "
"information.  The results show an extra line similar to this:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການສະແກນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ອົງກອນທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນສັງກັດຢູ່. ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Configuration``, ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files``. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ HTML ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນທຸກໆການສະແກນ, ເຊິ່ງມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຜົນລັດຈະສະແດງແຖວເພີ່ມເຕີມຄືແນວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml "
"scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"
msgstr "Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:69
msgid ""
"To retrieve scan information from the command line, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການສະແກນຈາກໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:71
msgid ""
"You can also use the {productname} API to view results, with the "
"``system.scap`` handler."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ API ຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການ ``system.scap``."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ (Remediation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Remediation Bash scripts and Ansible playbooks are provided in the same SCAP "
"Security Guide packages to harden the client systems.  For example:"
msgstr "ມີການສະໜອງສະຄຣິບ Remediation Bash ແລະ Ansible playbooks ໃນແພັກເກດ SCAP Security Guide ອັນດຽວກັນເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍມີຄວາມປອດໄພຂຶ້ນ (harden). ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "bash scripts"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bash"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-cis.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-cis.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible playbooks"
msgstr "Ansible playbooks"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:78
msgid ""
"You can run them using remote commands or with Ansible, after enabling "
"Ansible in the client system."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລັນພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ remote commands ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Ansible, ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ Ansible ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run remediation using a Bash script"
msgstr "ລັນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Install the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package on all your target "
"systems.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ໃນທຸກໆລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Packages, channels and scripts are different for each operating system and "
"distribution.  Examples are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ, ຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ ສະຄຣິບ ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ດິສຕຣິບິວຊັນ (distribution). ຕົວຢ່າງຕ່າງໆແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Bash script on single systems as a remote command"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ໃນລະບົບດ່ຽວໃນຮູບແບບ remote command"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:83
msgid "Run the Bash script as a remote command on single systems."
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເປັນ remote command ໃນລະບົບດ່ຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:84
msgid ""
"From menu:System[Overview] tab, select your instance.  Then in "
"menu:Details[Remote Commands], write a Bash script such as:"
msgstr "ຈາກແທັບ menu:System[Overview], ເລືອກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນໃນ menu:Details[Remote Commands], ໃຫ້ຂຽນສະຄຣິບ Bash ເຊັ່ນ:"

