#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with ``ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError``.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງຄ໌ລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (ISS) ໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ (caches) ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. ແຄຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເກີດບັກ (bugs) ທີ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ບັກອາດຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນລຸ້ນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ເພາະວ່າແຄຊ໌ຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຢູ່. ຖ້າທ່ານອັບເກຣດ ISS ເປັນລຸ້ນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງແຄຊ໌ທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າທີ່ກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊ໌ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບແຄຊ໌ໃນ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງຄ໌ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ ISS Caching"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງບໍລິການໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ໃນ ISS Master, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ໌ສຳລັບ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Local Issuer Certificates)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an ``Unrecognized error`` "
"about the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the "
"local issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"[path]``/etc/ssl/certs/`` directory.  If you come across this problem, you "
"should consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper "
"operates as expected."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງອັນສ້າງລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຜິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ zypper ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``Unrecognized error`` ກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກສ້າງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດສອບໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/ssl/certs/``. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ zypper ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 30{nbsp}ນາທີ. ອີງຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"and [path]``web.xml``.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, and in minutes in [path]``web.xml``.  The two "
"values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ [path]``web.xml``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນວິນາທີໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເປັນນາທີໃນ [path]``web.xml``. ທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເທົ່າກັບໄລຍະເວລາດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` to 3600 seconds, and the value in [path]``web.xml`` to 60 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າການໝົດເວລາເປັນໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ເປັນ 3600 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``web.xml`` ເປັນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າການໝົດເວລາການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:7
msgid "Stop services:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm stop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in seconds:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າການໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນວິນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"
msgstr "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:11
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:14
msgid "Save and close the file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in minutes:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າການໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"
msgstr "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:15
msgid "Restart services:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm start\n"
msgstr "mgradm start\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mail Configuration"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
