msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 seconds\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {webui} Fails to Load"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ {webui} ບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the {webui} will not load after migration.  This is usually "
"caused by browser caching, if the new system has the same hostname and IP "
"address as the old system.  This duplication can confuse some browsers."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ, {webui} ຈະບໍ່ໂຫຼດຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migration). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນເກີດຈາກແຄຊ໌ຂອງບຣາວເຊີ (browser caching), ຖ້າລະບົບໃໝ່ມີຊື່ໂຮສ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບເກົ່າ. ການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນນີອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບຣາວເຊີບາງອັນສັບສົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This issue is resolved by clearing the cache and reloading the page.  In "
"most browsers, you can do this quickly by pressing kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການລ້າງແຄຊ໌ ແລະ ໂຫຼດໜ້າໃໝ່. ໃນບຣາວເຊີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາໂດຍການກົດ kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Changelogs"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ Changelogs"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some packages have a long list of changelog entries.  This data is "
"downloaded by default, but it is not always useful information to keep.  In "
"order to limit the amount of changelog metadata which is downloaded and to "
"save disk space, you can put a limit on how many entries to keep on disk."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດບາງອັນມີລາຍການ changelog ຍາວຫຼາຍ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເໝີໄປທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້. ເພື່ອຈຳກັດປະລິມານເມຕາດາຕາຂອງ changelog ທີ່ຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເພື່ອປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງລາຍການທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This configuration option is in the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file.  The parameter defaults to [systemitem]``20``.  Changing "
"this value to [systemitem]``0`` will provide an unlimited number of entries."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ພາຣາມິເຕີມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ [systemitem]``20``. ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ [systemitem]``0`` ຈະເປັນການເກັບລາຍການແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"
msgstr "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter, it comes into effect only for new packages when "
"they are synchronized."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີນີ, ມັນຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບແພັກເກດໃໝ່ໃນເວລາທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກຊິງຄ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:7
msgid "After changing this parameter, restart services with ``mgradm restart``."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີນີ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມບໍລິການໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ``mgradm restart``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You might like to delete and regenerate the cached data to remove older "
"data."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນແຄຊ໌ໃໝ່ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Deleting and regenerating cached data can take a long time.  Depending on "
"the number of channels you have and the amount of data to be deleted, it can "
"potentially take several hours.  The task is run in the background by "
"Taskomatic, so you can continue to use {productname} while the operation "
"completes, however you should expect some performance loss."
msgstr "ການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນແຄຊ໌ໃໝ່ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານມີ ແລະ ປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະລຶບ, ມັນອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ. ວຽກນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງໂດຍ Taskomatic, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເຮັດວຽກກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ, ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບຫຼຸດລົງບາງສ່ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can delete and request a regeneration of cached data from the command "
"line:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບ ແລະ ຮ້ອງຂໍການສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນແຄຊ໌ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-sql -i\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-sql -i\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:12
msgid "Then on the SQL database prompt, enter:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ SQL ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"
msgstr ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can add new users, grant permissions, and "
"deactivate or delete users.  If you are managing a large number of users, "
"you can assign users to system groups to manage permissions at a group "
"level.  You can also change the system defaults for the {webui}, including "
"language and theme defaults."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ສາມາດເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ອະນຸຍາດສິດ, ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການສິດອະນຸຍາດໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {webui}, ລວມທັງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງພາສາ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (theme)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Users`` menu is only available if you are logged in with the "
"{productname} administrator account."
msgstr "ເມນູ [guimenu]``Users`` ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To manage {productname} users, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All] to "
"see all users in your {productname} Server.  Each user in the list shows the "
"username, real name, assigned roles, the date the user last signed in, and "
"the current status of the user.  Click btn:[Create User] to create a new "
"user account.  Click the username to go to the [guimenu]``User Details`` "
"page."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List > All] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນໃນລາຍຊື່ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຊື່ແທ້, ບົດບາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມອບໝາຍ, ວັນທີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຄັ້ງສຸດທ້າຍ, ແລະ ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຄລິກ btn:[Create User] ເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໄປຫາໜ້າ [guimenu]``User Details``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To add new users to your organization, click btn:[Create User], complete the "
"details for the new user, and click btn:[Create Login]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create User], ກອກລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create Login]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Password requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:7
msgid "{productname} is shipped with a selection of default values."
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To ensure that all new user passwords adhere to the organization's security "
"standards, {productname} administrator has the option to enforce the "
"password creation rules."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ທັງໝົດເປັນໄປຕາມມາດຕະຖານຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງອົງກອນ, ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການບັງຄັບໃຊ້ກົດການສ້າງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password "
"Policy] to define the password requirements.  Use a combination of the "
"following fields:"
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password Policy] ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງຟິວ (fields) ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Min Password Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:11
msgid "Use this field to define the minimal length of password."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Password Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:13
msgid "Use this field to define the maximum length of password."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວສູງສຸດຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Digits"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຕົວເລກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the digits "
"(0-9)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ (0-9) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Lowercase Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the lowercase "
"characters (a-z)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍ (a-z) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the uppercase "
"characters (A-Z)."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່ (A-Z) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Consecutive Characters"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ລຽງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:21
msgid "Use this field to specify whether the restricted consecutive characters."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸການຈຳກັດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ລຽງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Special Characters"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include special "
"characters."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດ ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allowed Special Characters"
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This field is enable only of the [literal]``Require Special Characters`` is "
"selected.  Use it to specify which special characters are allowed, for "
"example [literal]``!@#$%&*``, and others."
msgstr "ຟິວນີຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເລືອກ [literal]``Require Special Characters``. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດໃດແດ່ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ, ຕົວຢ່າງ [literal]``!@#$%&*``, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Character Occurences"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດການປາກົດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:27
msgid "Use this field to specify restricted character occurences."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸການຈຳກັດການປາກົດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Character Occurences"
msgstr "ການປາກົດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນສູງສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:29
msgid "Use this field to specify maximum character occurences."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຟິວນີເພື່ອລະບຸການປາກົດຂອງຕົວອັກສອນສູງສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:30
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to save any of the changed password settings."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:31
msgid "Use btn:[Reset] to change any settings to the default ones."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ btn:[Reset] ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດກັບໄປເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:32
msgid "{productname} is shipped with the following default values:"
msgstr "{productname} ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:33
msgid "Min Password Length: 4"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ: 4"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:34
msgid "Max Password Length: 32"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວລະຫັດຜ່ານສູງສຸດ: 32"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:35
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters: checked"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຕົວອັກສອນພິມໃຫຍ່: ເລືອກໄວ້"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deactivate and Delete Accounts"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ລຶບບັນຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can deactivate or delete user accounts if they are no longer required.  "
"Deactivated user accounts can be reactivated at any time.  Deleted user "
"accounts are not visible, and cannot be retrieved."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ລຶບບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແລ້ວ. ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານສາມາດກັບມາເປີດໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກລຶບຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Users can deactivate their own accounts.  However, if users have an "
"administrator role, the role must be removed before the account can be "
"deactivated."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີບົດບາດເປັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ, ຕ້ອງລຶບບົດບາດນັ້ນອອກກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານບັນຊີໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Deactivated users cannot log in to the {productname} {webui} or schedule any "
"actions.  Actions scheduled by a user prior to their deactivation remain in "
"the action queue.  Deactivated users can be reactivated by {productname} "
"administrators."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼື ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການກະທຳໃດໆໄດ້. ການກະທຳທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ກ່ອນການປິດການໃຊ້ງານຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຄິວການກະທຳ (action queue). ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານສາມາດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator Roles"
msgstr "ບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Users can hold multiple administrator roles, and there can be more than one "
"user holding any administrator role at any time.  There must always be at "
"least one active {productname} Administrator."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດມີບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໄດ້ຫຼາຍບົດບາດ, ແລະ ສາມາດມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄົນທີ່ມີບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ຕ້ອງມີຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄົນສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:42
msgid ""
"To change a user's administrator roles, except for the {productname} "
"Administrator role, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All], select the user "
"to change, and check or uncheck the administrator roles as required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຍົກເວັ້ນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List > All], ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:43
msgid ""
"To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Users] and check or uncheck [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` as "
"required."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Users] ແລ້ວເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ [guimenu]``{productname} Admin?`` ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Administrator Role Permissions"
msgstr "ສິດອະນຸຍາດຂອງບົດບາດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ"

#. type: Table
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role Name | Description\n"
"| System Group User | Standard role associated with all users.\n"
"| {productname} Administrator | Can perform all functions, including "
"changing privileges of other users.\n"
"| Organization Administrator | Manages activation keys, configurations, "
"channels, and system groups.\n"
"| Activation Key Administrator | Manages activation keys.\n"
"| Image Administrator | Manages image profiles, builds, and stores.\n"
"| Configuration Administrator | Manages system configuration.\n"
"| Channel Administrator | Manages software channels, including making "
"channels globally subscribable, and creating new channels.\n"
"| System Group Administrator | Manages systems groups, including creating "
"and deleting system groups, adding clients to existing groups, and managing "
"user access to groups.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Permissions and Systems"
msgstr "ສິດອະນຸຍາດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If you have created system groups to manage your clients, you can assign "
"groups to users for them to manage."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອຈັດການເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດກຸ່ມໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຈັດການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:48
msgid ""
"To assign a user to a system group, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the [guimenu]``System Groups`` tab.  Check "
"the groups to assign, and click btn:[Update Defaults]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``System Groups``. ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Defaults]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:49
msgid ""
"You can also select one or more default system groups for a user.  When the "
"user registers a new client, it is assigned to the chosen system group by "
"default.  This allows the user to immediately access the newly registered "
"client."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກກຸ່ມລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່, ມັນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#.  I really don't understand what this is. Need a sentence or two to explain it.  --LKB 2020-04-29
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:50
msgid ""
"To manage external groups, navigate to menu:Users[System Group "
"Configuration], and go to the [guimenu]``External Authentication`` tab.  "
"Click btn:[Create External Group] to create a new external group.  Give the "
"group a name, and assign it to the appropriate system group."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈັດການກຸ່ມພາຍນອກ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[System Group Configuration], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``External Authentication``. ຄລິກ btn:[Create External Group] ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມພາຍນອກໃໝ່. ຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:51
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:52
msgid ""
"To see the individual clients a user can administer, navigate to "
"menu:Users[User List], click the username to edit, and go to the "
"[guimenu]``Systems`` tab.  To carry out bulk tasks, you can select clients "
"from the list to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດດູແລໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Systems``. ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ (bulk tasks), ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈາກລາຍຊື່ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (system set manager)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and Channel Permissions"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສິດອະນຸຍາດຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:55
msgid ""
"You can assign users to software channels within your organization either as "
"a subscriber that consumes content from channels, or as an administrator, "
"who can manage the channels themselves."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ ທັງໃນຖານະຜູ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriber) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເນື້ອຫາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງ, ຫຼື ໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:56
msgid ""
"To subscribe a user to a channel, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription] "
"tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription]. ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:57
msgid ""
"To grant a user channel management permissions, navigate to menu:Users[User "
"List], click the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel "
"Permissions[Management] tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click "
"btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Users[User List], ຄລິກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Channel Permissions[Management]. ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການມອບໝາຍ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:58
msgid ""
"Some channels in the list might not be subscribable.  This is usually "
"because of the users administrator status, or the channels global settings."
msgstr "ບາງຊ່ອງທາງໃນລາຍຊື່ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນຍ້ອນສະຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Default Language"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:60
msgid ""
"When you create a new user, you can choose which language to use for the "
"{webui}.  After a user has been created, you can change the language by "
"navigating to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກພາສາທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui} ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນພາສາໄດ້ໂດຍການໄປທີ່ menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The default language is set in the ``rhn.conf`` configuration file.  To "
"change the default language, open the [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file and "
"add or edit this line:"
msgstr "ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``rhn.conf``. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"
msgstr "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:63
msgid "If the parameter is not set, the default language is ``en_US``."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້, ພາສາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``en_US``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:64
msgid "These languages are available in {productname}:"
msgstr "ພາສາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:65
#: modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Language Codes"
msgstr "ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ"

